  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The heartbreaking reality of babies in Cartagena</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the middle of the tourist city of Cartagena, Colombia has a harsh reality that goes unnoticed. The children of vulnerable teenage mothers in the city struggle to survive in a context of extreme poverty, lack of medical care, and malnutrition.   Our children are exposed to an uncertain and hopeless future that leads them to increased cycles of poverty.</narrative>
  </description>
